{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set nearby = get_nearby_actors(npc.UUID) %}
A nearby actor gives {{speakingNpc.name}}'s leash to another nearby actor, or to None to drop it and leave it hanging. Givers and receivers: {{ nearby.actorsNameString }}. Never pick {{speakingNpc.name}} as the receiver. Never pick anyone not listed except None.
